OL,3,GNEWSAMan who died in house explosion
OL,4,Anamed
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who died in a house explosion has
OL,7,Fbeen named, while officers
OL,8,Finvestigating his death say they
OL,9,Fbelieve there is "no evidence of a
OL,10,Fcrime".
OL,12,FRory Costello, 60, also known as Rory
OL,13,FConway, died in the explosion in
OL,14,FRotherham on Tuesday, according to
OL,15,FSouth Yorkshire Police.
OL,17,FIn a statement, the force said
OL,18,Finvestigations into the cause of the
OL,19,Fblast were ongoing but "no evidence" of
OL,20,Fany wrongdoing had been uncovered.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
